# 必考词 Unit20
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit20核心高频词汇

{{sample}}{/ˈsɑːmpl/}}{n. 样品；样本；v. 取样}}{{The researcher collected water samples from the river.}}

{{satellite}}{/ˈsætəlaɪt/}}{n. 卫星}}{{The satellite orbits the earth every 90 minutes.}}

{{satisfy}}{/ˈsætɪsfaɪ/}}{v. 满足；使满意}}{{The solution satisfied both parties in the negotiation.}}

{{scale}}{/skeɪl/}}{n. 规模；比例；天平}}{{The project was implemented on a large scale.}}

{{scan}}{/skæn/}}{v. 扫描；浏览}}{{She scanned the document for any errors.}}

{{schedule}}{/ˈʃedjuːl/}}{n. 时间表；v. 安排}}{{The meeting is scheduled for next Monday at 10 a.m.}}

{{scheme}}{/skiːm/}}{n. 计划；方案}}{{The government launched a new scheme to support small businesses.}}

{{scholar}}{/ˈskɒlər/}}{n. 学者；奖学金获得者}}{{The scholar published over fifty research papers.}}

{{scope}}{/skəʊp/}}{n. 范围；机会}}{{The scope of the investigation has been expanded.}}

{{scratch}}{/skrætʃ/}}{v. 抓；刮；n. 划痕}}{{The cat scratched the furniture with its claws.}}

{{screen}}{/skriːn/}}{n. 屏幕；v. 筛选}}{{All applicants are screened before the interview.}}

{{secure}}{/sɪˈkjʊər/}}{adj. 安全的；v. 获得}}{{The company secured a major contract with the government.}}

{{seek}}{/siːk/}}{v. 寻找；追求}}{{Many young people seek opportunities abroad.}}

{{segment}}{/ˈseɡmənt/}}{n. 部分；片段}}{{The company targets a specific market segment.}}

{{select}}{/sɪˈlekt/}}{v. 选择；adj. 精选的}}{{The committee selected the best candidates for the position.}}

{{senior}}{/ˈsiːniər/}}{adj. 高级的；年长的}}{{She is a senior manager in the company.}}

{{sense}}{/sens/}}{n. 感觉；意义；v. 感知}}{{There is no sense in arguing about this issue.}}

{{sensitive}}{/ˈsensətɪv/}}{adj. 敏感的；灵敏的}}{{The topic is very sensitive and should be handled carefully.}}

{{sequence}}{/ˈsiːkwəns/}}{n. 顺序；序列}}{{Please arrange the events in chronological sequence.}}

{{severe}}{/sɪˈvɪər/}}{adj. 严重的；严厉的}}{{The storm caused severe damage to the coastal town.}}

{{shadow}}{/ˈʃædəʊ/}}{n. 阴影；影子}}{{The tree cast a long shadow in the afternoon sun.}}

{{shallow}}{/ˈʃæləʊ/}}{adj. 浅的；肤浅的}}{{The river is too shallow for boats to navigate.}}

{{shelter}}{/ˈʃeltər/}}{n. 庇护所；v. 掩蔽}}{{The charity provides shelter for homeless people.}}

{{shift}}{/ʃɪft/}}{v./n. 转变；轮班}}{{There has been a shift in public opinion on the issue.}}

{{shortage}}{/ˈʃɔːrtɪdʒ/}}{n. 短缺；不足}}{{The region faces a严重 shortage of clean drinking water.}}

{{shrink}}{/ʃrɪŋk/}}{v. 收缩；减少}}{{The economy shrank by 2% during the recession.}}

{{signal}}{/ˈsɪɡnəl/}}{n. 信号；v. 发信号}}{{The traffic signal turned red just as we approached.}}

{{significance}}{/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns/}}{n. 重要性；意义}}{{The discovery has great significance for medical research.}}

{{similar}}{/ˈsɪmɪlər/}}{adj. 相似的；类似的}}{{The two proposals are similar in many ways.}}

{{simplify}}{/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/}}{v. 简化}}{{The new software simplifies the process of data analysis.}}

{{simultaneously}}{/ˌsɪmlˈteɪniəsli/}}{adv. 同时地}}{{The events occurred simultaneously across the country.}}

{{site}}{/saɪt/}}{n. 地点；网站}}{{The construction site is located near the city center.}}

{{sketch}}{/sketʃ/}}{n. 草图；概述；v. 画草图}}{{The architect drew a rough sketch of the building design.}}

{{slight}}{/slaɪt/}}{adj. 轻微的；少量的}}{{There was a slight improvement in the weather.}}

{{slip}}{/slɪp/}}{v. 滑倒；溜走；n. 纸条}}{{She slipped on the wet floor and fell.}}

{{smooth}}{/smuːð/}}{adj. 光滑的；顺利的}}{{The transition to the new system was remarkably smooth.}}

{{solar}}{/ˈsəʊlər/}}{adj. 太阳的}}{{Solar energy is a clean and renewable resource.}}

{{sole}}{/səʊl/}}{adj. 唯一的；n. 鞋底}}{{He was the sole survivor of the accident.}}

{{solid}}{/ˈsɒlɪd/}}{adj. 固体的；可靠的}}{{The theory is based on solid evidence from experiments.}}

{{solution}}{/səˈluːʃn/}}{n. 解决方案；溶液}}{{We need to find a practical solution to this problem.}}
